---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';

const lastUpdated = 'April 2026';
---

<Base title="Terms — The Sustainability Diet" description="Terms of use for sustainabilitydiet.com, including copyright, permitted use of text and data, and disclaimers.">
  <article class="mx-auto max-w-reading px-6 pt-20 pb-32">

    <p class="small-caps text-xs text-ochre mb-4">Terms of use</p>
    <h1 class="font-display text-4xl md:text-5xl tracking-tight leading-tight mb-4">
      Terms.
    </h1>
    <p class="small-caps text-xs text-ink/50 mb-12">Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p>

    <div class="prose-reading text-lg leading-relaxed text-ink/85 space-y-7">

      <h2 class="font-display text-2xl md:text-3xl tracking-tight mt-8 mb-6">
        Copyright.
      </h2>
      <p>
        All original text and original editorial content on this
        site is copyright Karen Pendergrass, unless a specific
        attribution notes otherwise. The Prologue published on the
        excerpt page is an excerpt from <em>The Sustainability Diet</em>,
        forthcoming. Reproduction of whole chapters or whole pages
        requires permission; short quotation with attribution is
        covered by standard fair-use practice and does not require
        permission.
      </p>

      <h2 class="font-display text-2xl md:text-3xl tracking-tight mt-12 mb-6">
        Data used by the atlas.
      </h2>
      <p>
        Scientific data displayed on the site is drawn from
        third-party sources under their own licenses. These licenses
        are respected and every dataset is attributed at the
        component level, at the page level, and on the
        <a href="/data-attribution" class="text-ochre hover:underline">data attribution page</a>.
        If you reuse any data that appears on this site, respect
        the originating license, not this page's.
      </p>

      <h2 class="font-display text-2xl md:text-3xl tracking-tight mt-12 mb-6">
        Linking.
      </h2>
      <p>
        Linking to any page on this site from anywhere else is
        welcome and does not require permission. Linking to the
        site in a way that misrepresents its contents (frame
        replacement, reader-mode scraping presented as the
        operator's work, or similar) is not welcome and is not
        consented to.
      </p>

      <h2 class="font-display text-2xl md:text-3xl tracking-tight mt-12 mb-6">
        Not medical, legal, or investment advice.
      </h2>
      <p>
        The book and the site discuss food, land, agriculture,
        ecology, and related topics. Nothing here is medical,
        legal, investment, or professional agricultural advice.
        Decisions that touch your health, your land, or your
        capital should involve the relevant professionals.
      </p>

      <h2 class="font-display text-2xl md:text-3xl tracking-tight mt-12 mb-6">
        &ldquo;As is.&rdquo;
      </h2>
      <p>
        The site is offered as-is, without warranty of any kind,
        including warranty of fitness for purpose. The site
        operator attempts accuracy and corrects errors when they
        are pointed out, but does not warrant that every statement
        is correct at every moment. The atlas is a work in progress;
        it will carry per-page last-updated dates once the build
        reaches publication tempo.
      </p>

      <h2 class="font-display text-2xl md:text-3xl tracking-tight mt-12 mb-6">
        Contact.
      </h2>
      <p>
        Questions about these terms, or permission requests, go to
        <a href="mailto:karen@paleofoundation.com" class="text-ochre hover:underline">karen@paleofoundation.com</a>.
      </p>

    </div>
  </article>
</Base>
